WEBVTT

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:43.630
"Autumn breeze,

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.270
at whose grave does my index finger point?"

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.880
<b>Shuji Terayama</b>

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.640
References should always be made clear.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.100
So, anyway...

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.510
Doctor!

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:00.990
Blood!

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.910
Draw my blood!

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:03.030
I'm first!

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:04.050
Don't be ridiculous! I'm first!

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:05.370
Okay, okay.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.710
Line up in order, starting 
with ticket number 32.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:09.820
I'm 32!

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:11.100
I'm 32!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.410
I'm 32, too!

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:14.560
No cutting in line.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.320
Doctor, I need you to work tonight.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.910
I shouldn't have agreed to do this.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.040
I'm going to work myself to death.

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:27.040
You need to appeal directly 
to the students' desires.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:31.550
Our advisor is the infirmary's 
dynamite Doctor Chihiro Chimatsuri!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:42.800
<b>Blood Donation Club</b>

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.430
Enjoy the doctor's hospitable care!

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:35.540
What?!

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.610
The Blood Donation Club has Korean 
hotties and blood transfusion mixers!

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:42.370
Couples that form will receive 
an annual pass to Mousenyland!

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.370
Not only that, but it's all boys.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.230
Where are the girls?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:54.140
The collective excitement a group of 
girls feels is usually only temporary.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:00.610
<b>Chuck Flap</b>

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:00.480
Out of the way, herbivores!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.980
Doctor Chihiro!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.990
<b>Karate Club Captain Masumi Katsuno</b>

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.540
I, Karate club captain Masumi Katsuno,

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:11.780
have come to offer up my copious 
and thick blood drawn.

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:12.590
Osu!

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:18.410
Our karate club does not use 
empty words like "osu!"

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:21.590
Usu.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:22.760
Nor do we use "usu!"

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.480
Stop wasting your blood!

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:30.040
Yikes. These guys are blood 
donating enthusiasts, too?

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.450
That's enough. No need to keep beating him.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:38.020
This school is full of perverts who 
can't stay calm when they see blood.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:43.590
Blood. Blood!

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:50.700
Excellent.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.550
This is it. Nothing beats this.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.680
That's one patient done. Next.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:59.690
What? What about my hospitable care?

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.600
You'll get it once you 
accumulate 100 points.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.570
Here's your point card.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.390
Blood Donation Point Card

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.780
You get one point for every 400cc drawn.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.770
Your card expires after six months.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.900
I've been tricked!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.910
Come on, next patient.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:13.900
Osu!

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.560
Don't speak that word again!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.310
Hey, cut that out.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:23.020
Growing boys are full of 
all manner of things.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.200
It's nothing unusual.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.570
Really?

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.510
Wait, why should we accept this?

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:31.120
Get out of here. We're done for tonight!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.710
Hold it right there.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:41.960
Aren't you guys familiar with 
the phrase "ladies first"?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.960
<b>Dance Club Captain</b>

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.960
<b>Nami Unten</b>

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:47.720
<b>Cinema Club Captain
Maki Watabe</b>

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:47.910
That's right. Our blood takes priority 
over your greasy fatty blood.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:52.560
<b>Cosplay Club Captain
Kaoru Konno</b>

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.210
That's right, blood.

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:52.570
In Heaven's place, I offer 
you my angel blood.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.150
Thank you.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:57.480
I promise your good intentions 
won't go to waste.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.530
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:04.440
<i>I know these girls are secretly blood 
donating enthusiasts and perverts, too.</i>

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.580
Whose blood are you calling fatty?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:12.210
Your cholesterol is high, 
and your Gamma-GTP is over 200.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.380
No, it's not!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:17.790
Your average blood pressure is over 250, 
and your urine protein content is 2+.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.140
No, it's not!

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:24.010
You're at risk for prostatic hypertrophy, 
and your risk of hair loss is over 80%.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.590
No, it's not!

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.600
How long are you going to keep doing that?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:29.600
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.990
Anyway, we've been dealing with a lot.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:39.120
Before we draw your blood, 
you'll need to join the club.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:43.260
What? Join what club?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:44.830
The Blood Donation Club.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.290
No one told us about that.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:49.030
Well, actually—

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.110
You won't drawn our blood 
unless we join your club?

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:54.590
It's not complicated.

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:57.660
There's no initiation fee, and you don't 
need to present your family register.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:00.310
And if you've forgotten your family seal, 
you can sign your application with blood.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.410
That's not the problem.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.970
I'm busy.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.540
I've got club members to look after.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:08.790
I don't think I can handle 
two clubs at once.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.470
It's just a formality.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:14.220
Doctor Chihiro and I will handle 
all the actual drawing of blood.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.160
All you need to do is periodically 
have yours drawn.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.120
I promise it won't be any trouble at all.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:21.800
This is starting to sound fishy.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.450
I smell an MLM or a rat.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.310
You're running a crooked business.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:28.500
Please, I'm begging you, 
I'd be eternally grateful.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.980
We can't draw blood at school unless 
we gather enough club members.

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:35.270
That's none of our concern.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.170
I'll give my blood, but I'm not 
interested in any blood ties.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.470
But I do want your milk.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.730
Don't you care about anything 
besides your own pleasure?

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.260
Nope.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:49.610
Egoists! Selfish! Hedonists!

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:51.380
Are you different?

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:54.550
That's enough!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.210
I knew you were behind this foolishness.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.610
<b>Discipline Committee Chairman
Jinko Sumida</b>

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.680
<i>Crap. My greatest enemy, Jinko-chan.</i>

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:10.640
Who are you calling your enemy?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.790
I didn't say that.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.350
But how dare you call this foolishness?

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:23.220
The Blood Donation Club is performing this 
volunteer work to help the world and its people.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.920
When was a Blood Donation Club formed?

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:29.570
I'm working right now to 
form a Blood Donation—

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.200
School Regulation Article 23!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.590
<b>School Regulation Article 23</b>

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:36.710
Aggressive club recruitment that ignores or 
violates an individual's will is prohibited.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.710
You know that, don't you?

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.110
I had no idea.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:43.880
Aggressive? What have you been up to?

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:47.030
I've just been talking 
to all the girls I can.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:50.830
All of them? You mean the cute girls?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.730
Well, yeah.

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:55.520
I can't let Mai drink any ugly blood.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:58.680
But you didn't talk to Jinko?

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:02.200
You screwed up this time, Mitsugu Bambam.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.260
It's Bamba.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:05.120
What are you two arguing about?

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.450
I order you to disperse immediately.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:11.080
And doctor, I expect better from you.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.890
Now, now. What's the problem?

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:18.640
It's in the spirit of one 
for all and all for one.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:22.040
Why don't you have your blood drawn, too?

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.270
It'll make you feel better.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.900
No, thank you.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:39.860
<i>Could it be that Jinko is secretly a 
blood donating enthusiast, too?</i>

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.220
Nami Unten

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.220
Maki Watabe

00:08:55.490 --> 00:09:01.000
Despite what they said, 
everyone had their blood drawn.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.180
No one can resist having their blood drawn.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:09.730
Anyway, shouldn't this be enough to 
keep her from starving for a while?

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:12.760
No. Only these three are usable.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:18.160
That's just those three girls' blood.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.110
If Mai drinks those filthy boys' blood...

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:24.400
She'll become hairy.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.660
And greasy.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.250
Her feet will stink.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:32.170
She'll start grinding her teeth.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.230
And grow a third eye on her forehead.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:38.220
I wouldn't be able to stand that!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:42.670
I understand how you feel, 
but blood is blood.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.650
It's an emotional matter.

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.410
But girls are okay?

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.100
Better than horny males.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:54.700
I see. Then all the rest 
of the blood is mine?

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.100
You're welcome to it.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:57.840
Dump it down the drain for all I care.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.930
I'd never do anything so wasteful.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.810
After all the hazardously 
hard work I put in,

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:08.340
I'll make sure to put it to 
good use in my research.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.150
Anyway, we sure did get a lot of type A.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:17.540
Maybe that's why people think Japanese 
people are so serious and businesslike.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:19.350
That's just popular belief.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:22.920
There's no scientific basis for 
blood type-based personalities.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.380
No way. People say it all the time.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.590
Type As are serious.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:31.520
<b>Former
Wehrmacht Commander
Erich von Manstein</b>

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.160
Prussian field marshals do not mutiny.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:39.410
<b>Andy Warhol</b>

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.270
Type B's are eccentric.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:38.930
In the future, everyone will be 
world-famous for 15 minutes.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.830
Type O's are cavalier and bold.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:44.410
<b>Movie Director
Kenji Miya</b>

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:44.240
Only savages make movies.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:50.540
<b>Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde</b>

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.240
And type AB's...

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.890
Are two-faced?

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.250
Yeah, that.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:58.320
Only Japanese people fuss over blood 
type-based fortune telling and compatibility.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.810
What? Seriously?

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.860
Then no matter what blood type Mai drinks,

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:05.900
there's no risk of it having 
strange effects on her?

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:07.680
Let me ask you this.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:14.590
Did that vampire girl change in anyway after 
drinking your rare chimera type blood?

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.880
She seemed very happy.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.770
She squealed with joy.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:22.730
Idiot! Everyone becomes happy 
when their hunger is sated!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.780
By the way, what's your blood type, doctor?

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.440
That's a state secret.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.880
Do you still want to know?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.240
No, I'm good.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:40.380
<i>Regardless of her blood type, I can't 
give Mai this dangerous woman's blood.</i>

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.180
<i>I doubt she'd give me hers, anyway.</i>

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:45.830
<i>But I can't have Mai turning into a 
pervert because of the doctor's blood.</i>

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.450
I know exactly what you're thinking!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.320
Well? Did you like it?

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:08.900
Yes. I feel rejuvenated.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.000
W-W-Wait, Mai.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:11.800
Huh?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.110
Chihiro said...

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:19.310
Whatever you do, don't mix the 
blood types you feed her.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:23.030
If you mix blood of different types...

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.480
It could cause coagulation or hemolysis.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:38.770
<b>Coagulation</b>

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:38.770
<b>Hemolysis</b>

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.860
Eventually the blood itself 
will become a mess.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.770
<b>This image is fictional and differs
from scientific fact.</b>

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:43.250
That's common sense for a blood fanatic.

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:45.070
That's what she said.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:48.460
<i>Is it okay if they mix inside her stomach?</i>

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.370
Mai, why don't you wait before the next—

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.110
Delicious. I feel refreshed.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:09.130
Whatever will be will be... or won't.

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.930
Which is it again?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.010
<i>A cavalier and pragmatic type O?</i>

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:17.660
There's no point in me being alive.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:22.890
No, I'm not a spineless vampire.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:26.580
<i>A complicated and two-faced type AB?</i>

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.830
This is bad. It really is affecting her.

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:34.420
Her personality is changing according 
to the order of the blood she drank.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.710
<b>Kaoru Konno</b>

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.160
More blood.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.260
It's already quite late.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.330
Don't you think this is a bit much?

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.140
Oh, please. You're so mean.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.160
I want it now.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:58.110
I want that now.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:02.810
You really can't wait?

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:04.890
No.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:17.580
<b>"Bloody SOS"</b>

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:17.580
<b>Lyrics by: Yumi Kojima
Song by: Kenji Kawai</b>

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:16.410
Let's have another great night!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.210
What?

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:24.770
<i>The night is anxious, 
your sleepiness will go flying.</i>

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:25.220
<i>I knew this was coming!</i>

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:32.010
<i>Blood vessels flow so 
smoothly, not enough blood.</i>

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:28.130
<i>She turned into a party animal type B.</i>

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:32.020
<i>Chihiro lied to me. 
It's totally affecting her.</i>

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:35.700
<i>SOS I give myself to you.</i>

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:39.100
<i>SOS See how it flows.</i>

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:48.480
<i>SOS I pour out for you, 
light the fire of temp...tation...</i>

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:49.490
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:50.860
Mai!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.920
No, it's nothing.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.630
This isn't anything.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:58.560
I want more.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.170
Huh?

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.200
I want more blood.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:01.950
What?

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:05.540
Perhaps it's because I moved 
so much, but I'm hungry again.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:08.840
Is there anymore blood?

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:24.100
<i>Once I thaw this, there won't be any left.</i>

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.870
H-H-Hot!

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.990
Mai, it's a little hot, 
but I had some backup—

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.660
What are you drinking?

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.580
Beelzebub.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:55.190
Excavated in Iraq in 1982.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.470
Estimated 2000 BC.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:02.020
<b>Do Not Drink</b>

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:09.990
Dramatic Recreation

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:11.950
What?!

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:14.600
Mai?

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:19.000
Buzz? Why are you buzzing?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.710
Mai...

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:37.020
Hey! Why have you been hiding this 
delicious blood from me until now?

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.080
Well, actually—

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:40.440
It's delicious.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.660
I've never tasted anything

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.100
so incredible.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:50.390
Mai, let's calm down for 
the night and go to sleep.

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:51.690
Shut up!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.000
Stay out of my way!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.430
I'm going for a walk!

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:01.570
Mai, don't do that!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:13.760
Mommy!

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.760
Here we go!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.380
Well? Does that feel good?

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.960
It feels so good, I'm going to be sick.

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:27.730
<i>But doing this kind of puts me at ease.</i>

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.890
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.550
<i>Could it be?</i>

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.800
I'll make you feel even better.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.140
I feel sick!

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:53.180
Mommy!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:06.020
Maybe I'll skip playing <i>Fallout 4</i> 
tonight and go to bed early.

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:18.940
Ow...

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:22.100
I'll use this flashlight 
I have for some reason.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.960
Where am I?

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.170
Mai.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.060
Good. She's all right, too.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.690
That buzzing must've worn off.

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:45.960
Mai. Mai.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:50.910
Oh? Where are we?

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.910
Mai, don't move a millimeter.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.870
Don't look, don't listen, don't smell.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:56.980
What?

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:00.440
No matter what you think you 
see, it's just a big dog, okay?

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.490
A doggy? Where?

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.560
He's so cute.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:07.970
You're so furry.

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.950
So wonderfully wild, too.

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:11.440
Huh? Oh, please.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.880
You think I'm cute? You lady killer.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:18.140
Mai, you idiot, don't—

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.620
What? You want to go on a walk 
because it's a full moon?

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:23.540
Huh?

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:28.040
Then let's all go on a walk on 
this moonlit night together.

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:33.110
The buzzing hasn't worn off yet.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.200
Go!

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.240
Come with me, gorilla!

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:53.920
And you, hippo!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.880
And you, with the marvelous horn!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:00.800
Let's go!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.780
<b>Chimidoro Sports</b>

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.780
<b>High
Alert</b>

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.780
<b>Nighttime Disturbance in Chimidoro</b>

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.780
<b>Filming for a movie?</b>

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.740
Chimidoro
Newspaper

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.740
Chimidoro on High Alert!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.740
"Horde of Animals Escapes
from Zoo at Night"

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:42.280
<i>The commotion lasted until morning.</i>

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:46.690
<i>As the effects of that suspicious demon's 
blood wore off, things quieted down.</i>

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:50.550
<i>This disturbance made two things clear.</i>

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:56.740
<i>First, Mai is absolutely affected by the 
blood she drinks, which changes her personality.</i>

00:20:57.110 --> 00:21:01.190
<i>Second, it's impossible 
to predict what superpower</i>

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:06.800
<i>Mai will exhibit, 
depending on her excitement level.</i>

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:13.880
<i>Living with Mai might be even 
crazier than I imagined.</i>

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:19.180
<i>Either way, I'm past the point of no return.</i>

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:21.450
<i>I don't have a choice anymore.</i>

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:27.760
<i>But if Mai's personality changes 
according to the blood she drinks,</i>

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:33.220
<i>it may be possible to turn her 
exactly into my type of girl.</i>

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:39.360
<i>My type of girl? What am I talking about?</i>

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:41.740
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.500
<i>Mai is cuter than anyone else,</i>

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:48.700
<i>and cuteness should be 
prioritized over all else.</i>

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Living with a vampire is 
an uncommon experience.</i>

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:59.010
<i>By the way, what's Mai doing now?</i>

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:08.570
<i>She's actually still with the animals.</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:59.990
<b>Episode 3 "Sabbath Night Fever"</b>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:48.720
I'm very impressed.

00:23:48.720 --> 00:23:53.620
It's rare that someone can suck a human's 
blood without internal conflict or hesitation.

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.170
You ate all the gyoza?

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:57.530
At least put sauce on them!
